[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2994310885","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107861#issuecomment-2994310885","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107861","id":2994310885,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yeY7l","user":{"login":"ydeltastar","id":133662278,"node_id":"U_kgDOB_eGRg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133662278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar","html_url":"https://github.com/ydeltastar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-22T16:42:24Z","updated_at":"2025-06-22T16:42:24Z","body":"What is the difference from using `_exit_tree()` in the `EditorPlugin`?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2994310885/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2994314201","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107861#issuecomment-2994314201","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107861","id":2994314201,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yeZvZ","user":{"login":"Naros","id":3255568,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTU1Njg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3255568?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros","html_url":"https://github.com/Naros","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-22T16:49:26Z","updated_at":"2025-06-22T16:53:09Z","body":"@ydeltastar here's an example of what a real GDExtension plugin may implement, using ScriptEditor as an example:\r\n```cpp\r\nvoid ScriptEditorPlugin::save_external_data() {\r\n\tif (!EditorNode::get_singleton()->is_exiting()) {\r\n\t\tscript_editor->save_all_scripts();\r\n\t}\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nRight now this requires silly hacks like this:\r\n```cpp\r\n    const bool editor_exiting = EditorInterface::get_singleton()->get_base_control()->get_modulate() != Color(1, 1, 1, 1);\r\n    if (!editor_exiting && _editor_panel)\r\n        _editor_panel->save_all_resources();\r\n```\r\n\r\nIf how Editor dimming changes in the future, that logic breaks and becomes brittle. A reliable and consistent way should be provided so that the same sort of behavior can be achieved in GDExtension.\r\n\r\nI think relying on `_exit_tree` may work in some circumstances, but it would not here because the editor calls back into the `_save_external_data` before the `EditorPlugin` is removed from the scene tree.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2994314201/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4914079898","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107861#issuecomment-4914079898","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107861","id":4914079898,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJObomg","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-08T10:58:08Z","updated_at":"2026-07-08T10:58:20Z","body":"> With `is_exiting()` check:\r\n> Nagranie.ekranu_20260708_113030.webm\r\n> \r\n> We should probably update documentation to recommend using this method.\r\n\r\nWouldn't that leak the dock?\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4914079898/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4914103725","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107861#issuecomment-4914103725","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107861","id":4914103725,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJOdFrQ","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-08T11:01:03Z","updated_at":"2026-07-08T11:01:40Z","body":"The editor does the cleanup automatically, unregistering everything manually when exiting is unnecessary. And docks specifically are nodes, so they get freed with the scene tree.\r\n\r\nThe unregistering methods only exist to allow disabling the plugins dynamically. The native plugins don't use them.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4914103725/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]